# Stubbed UI tests

- Prefer the `stubbed-ui-test-author` skill when creating new page/component unit tests.
- Co-locate `ComponentName.test.tsx` next to the source file.
- Mock the package `api` module; use that package’s `src/test/whenApi` and `renderPage` (`web`, `frontends/catalog`, `frontends/orders`).
- Always `await renderPage(...)` so effects flush.
- Assert with `screen.getByTestId(...)`; prefer adding a `data-testid` over role/text queries.
- No real network, Cypress, or Playwright in these files.
